{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52050","headline":"山中避暑 · 王绩","name":"山中避暑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽人自可怜，避暑更萧然。\n片云堪度雨，小树即生烟。\n岩雪频经夏，溪冰定几年？\n横阶看卧石，隔牖听飞泉。\n地使炎凉变，人疑岁序迁。\n讵知来遁俗，更似得逃年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52050.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52050","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}